    "text": "<p>Given below are the quantum numbers for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;electrons.</p><p>A.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>B.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>C.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>D.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The correct order of increasing energy is</p>"
