  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Energy order of sub-shell decided by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;value.</p><p>Greater the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;value of a sub-shell greater is its energy.</p><p>If two sub-shells&nbsp;have same&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;values the orbital with greater principal quantum number has greater energy</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
